{"3570840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Allen", "steam_appid": 3570840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <i>Allen</i>, a cat with a bad attitude and a perfect life at the pet shelter. The humans? Annoying. The other animals? Tolerable. The only thing that matters is doing whatever you want—knocking things over, claiming the best nap spots, and making sure no one forgets who’s in charge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cause Chaos</strong> – Swipe things off tables, trip humans, and create havoc wherever you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Treats</strong> – Find hidden treats in every level to flex your mischievous skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun the Chaos</strong> – Complete levels as fast (or as ridiculously) as possible while creating total mayhem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape Your “Forever Home”</strong> – Each level, your goal is simple: get adopted… and then immediately get yourself returned by causing enough chaos to drive your new owner mad.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allen has everything he needs right here… and he’s not about to let anyone ruin it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and embrace the chaos!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <i>Allen</i>, a cat with a bad attitude and a perfect life at the pet shelter. The humans? Annoying. The other animals? Tolerable. The only thing that matters is doing whatever you want—knocking things over, claiming the best nap spots, and making sure no one forgets who’s in charge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cause Chaos</strong> – Swipe things off tables, trip humans, and create havoc wherever you go.</p></li><li><p class